  "notes": "Name matches that are not ABN matches, so never relations or edges. name_match_without_msr_abn: the entity's name equals one screened provider's legal name but the statement gives no ABN for it. msr_abn_differs_from_provider_abn: the name matches but the statement's ABN differs from the provider's. name_match_provider_abn_not_resolved: the name matches and the statement gives an ABN, but the provider has no accepted ABN. ambiguous_matches_several_providers: the name equals several providers' legal names. fuzzy_corporate_suffix_differs: the names match only without a PTY LTD, LTD or INC suffix. Not evidence of ownership. Rows carry statement ids, URLs, ABNs and candidate provider approval numbers; no names. Raw MSR inputs listed here are a local cache only (data/raw/msr/ is gitignored: licence unclear)."
